  "claim": "Every original literal and native profile stays identical. Default-skin inherited colors, alpha, widths and filters are not required. Named nondefault source-selected tokens remain required on visible owned carriers, independent of unrequested neutral decoration. Explicit colors/opacity/width/filter requests are retained; timeline disableMulticolor requires same-kind equality outside qualified owner overrides. No expected value comes from candidate pixels. PNG token relations require independently qualified compositing or remain unknown. Boston remains the sole source-pending drawing.",
